WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Open SD-Orders.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.210
Every job starts as a task in New Orders.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.700
Set the due date, the type, and the priority.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.060
Talk in the task. Tag your teammate.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.980
Status moves the job. Never drag a task.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.430
Design hands off with Ready For Print, or Ready for Outsource.
